{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JnG9QvoNnA1793745135.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券與本港收市比較，造價普遍較低。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合132.6元，比本港收市低1.5元。工商銀行7.71元，低3仙。建設銀行10.02元，低9仙。友邦保險75.7元，低5仙。港交所375.4元，低2元。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股395.64元，低1.56元。阿里巴巴98.44元，低1.11元。理想汽車43.96元，低0.4元。金沙中國11.3元，低8仙。長和67.25元，低0.45元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:20:58.036136+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T22:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:58:22.796982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:18:22.411197+00:00","content_hash":"033b94540bd66884b62900173c3550239f75405e69fac220a2b8b385f0f173af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:20:58.036136+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}